WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:04,150
There is no shortage of suitable candidates for physical fitness, Sanda and firearms.

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,990
Linquan can assist in teaching Sanda

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:12,180
The trouble is swordsmanship, swordsmanship and suppression, except for Lin Quan

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:13,900
There are currently no candidates for other courses

5
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:19,370
Swords and suppression methods are inheritances that are not passed down to outsiders. We will not force them.

6
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,010
Is anyone here willing to sign up?

7
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:25,860
time permitting

8
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,380
I can teach you swordsmanship

9
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,140
He wants to pass on that set of swordsmanship.

10
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:31,970
I can also teach swordsmanship

11
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,690
My sect doesn't care about these sword skills. I'm almost like a royal when I come here.

12
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,170
Don’t you care whether it’s rumored or not?

13
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,580
Survive first, then talk about inheritance

14
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:41,370
everyone is dead

15
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:42,650
Could it be passed on to ghosts?

16
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,860
I will punish you

17
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,700
Just call me "teacher" to teach me, and it won't be considered a side story.

18
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:51,170
You can teach me. No problem. Count me in.

19
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:53,130
Much smoother than expected
